@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Canonical interprocedural taint witness

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC

participant "Source call\nAmbient(env)" as Source #FFE8CC
participant "Caller DFG\nargument 0" as Caller #FFF3BF
participant "Resolved call\nconfidence tier" as Call #C3FAE8
participant "Callee summary\nParam(0) → command" as Summary #E5DBFF
participant "Sink call\nCWE-78" as Sink #FFE3E3
participant "TaintAnalysis\nordered finding" as Report #FCC2D7

Source -> Caller : DefUse / value composition
Caller -> Call : actual argument 0
Call -> Summary : Parameter edge + current jump function
Summary -> Sink : canonical parameter-to-sink suffix
Sink -> Report : source, sink, class, CWE, witness

note over Source,Caller #FFF3BF
  Prefix confidence is the source-pattern score.
end note

note over Call,Summary #C3FAE8
  Composition takes the minimum of catalog,
  call-resolution, and suffix confidence.
end note

note over Sink,Report #FFE3E3
  Ties prefer uncapped, higher-confidence,
  shorter, then lexicographically smaller NodeId paths.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#FFE8CC>| classified source |
|<#FFF3BF>| caller-local data flow |
|<#C3FAE8>| resolved call boundary |
|<#E5DBFF>| reusable procedure summary |
|<#FFE3E3>| classified sink |
|<#FCC2D7>| canonical advisory report |
endlegend
@enduml
